# Concerted Effort ({2}{W}{W}): "...creatures you control gain [protection] until end of turn if a creature you control has
# [it]." White Knight has protection from black and Angelic Curator protection from artifacts, so at each upkeep the Savannah
# Lions gains both: on turn 7 it is protected from black, and Bot2's Ornithopter (an artifact creature) can't block it, so
# it deals its 2 damage. Protection from a card type is not one of the five colors the grant used to cover (CR 702.16a).

